    "body": "The head is now 1e10d50265afd7b4a32d851f50e15ea7d42358bd. It is a merge of `origin/main` at 475373093 (class DELTA).\n\nThe merge had one conflict. I resolved it by hand in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`:\n- I kept the new `export_tool_library` and `import_tool_library` descriptions from main.\n- I kept the `set_stock` description of this branch, with `axis` and `angles_deg`.\n- The tool order is the same as on main.\n\nThe two sides changed different tool rows, not the same logic. All other files merged automatically. The change does not touch the project file format (v73). The quick gate runs again on this head.\n",
